      },
      "text": "0.561",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.607409266680649,
        "x1": 0.7950100023756261,
        "y1": 0.6169588675475401
      },
      "text": "Notes: IM= Internal Marketing; IBE= Internal Brand Equity; BO= Brand Orientation; JS= Job Satisfaction;**p<0.01; *<0.05",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15121951568097042,
        "y0": 0.6319246570767671,
        "x1": 0.8833693919751797,
        "y1": 0.6437547597446536
      },
      "text": "In order to examine the proposed hypotheses, partial-least-squares regression (PLS) was employed.  The",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.6456076542898894,
        "x1": 0.8833572940304819,
        "y1": 0.6574377569577758
      },
      "text": "number of usable questionnaires was the key factor for choosing PLS as the method for testing the model. PLS",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.6592906515030116,
        "x1": 0.882960932554196,
        "y1": 0.6711207541708981
      },
      "text": "path models are categorized as inner and outer models. While the inner model specifies the relationship between",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.6728311594064496,
        "x1": 0.8828628161721978,
        "y1": 0.684661262074336
      },
      "text": "latent variables, the outer model  shows the relationship between a latent variable and its related observed",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.6865141566195718,
        "x1": 0.8830663282080041,
        "y1": 0.6983442592874582
      },
      "text": "variable. Furthermore, the outer model can be used for testing the hypothesis. As a result, the output of the PLS",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.7001971719564932,
        "x1": 0.4487488063634631,
        "y1": 0.7120272746243798
      },
      "text": "which is the outer model is provided in figure 1.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15121951568097042,
        "y0": 0.7138801872934148,
        "x1": 0.8827147701370822,
        "y1": 0.7257102899613013
      },
      "text": "The standardized path  coefficients (β) support that brand orientation is an antecedent of internal brand",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.727563184506537,
        "x1": 0.8830636625591725,
        "y1": 0.7393932871744235
      },
      "text": "equity and positively affects internal brand equity (β=.23, t=2.06).  The results of the analysis indicate that job",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.7412461998434585,
        "x1": 0.8832423635558527,
        "y1": 0.7530763025113449
      },
      "text": "satisfaction has no significant relationship with internal brand equity (β=-.039, t=-.579).  The argument that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.754786671499298,
        "x1": 0.8824057599225127,
        "y1": 0.7666167741671844
      },
      "text": "internal marketing is an antecedent and positively related to internal brand equity is supported by the findings",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.7685053182255401,
        "x1": 0.13521622884163795,
        "y1": 0.7803354208934266
      },
      "text": "(β",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1350937371515726,
        "y0": 0.7685053182255401,
        "x1": 0.14463012147829238,
        "y1": 0.7803354208934266
      },
      "text": "=",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14456763251817956,
        "y0": 0.7685053182255401,
        "x1": 0.8789871550051666,
        "y1": 0.7803354208934266
      },
      "text": ".63, t=5.27). Also, the argument that job satisfaction is an antecedent and that it is positively related to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.7821883335624616,
        "x1": 0.8830541277383512,
        "y1": 0.7940184362303481
      },
      "text": "internal branding is supported in the findings  (β=1.57, t=2.44).  And finally results revealed that the path",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.7958713488993832,
        "x1": 0.8713468031193439,
        "y1": 0.8077014515672696
      },
      "text": "between internal marketing and brand orientation was indeed positive with strong relationship (β=.85, t=12.19).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.12098367613249228,
        "y0": 0.8205292693837338,
        "x1": 0.1686174238528294,
        "y1": 0.830078870250625
      },
      "text": "Table 2:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1719747316626654,
        "y0": 0.8205292693837338,
        "x1": 0.379191006911199,
        "y1": 0.830078870250625
      },
      "text": "Path coefficient of the research model.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1544446688237261,
        "y0": 0.8320743107424178,
        "x1": 0.2148810793361396,
        "y1": 0.8416239116093089
      },
      "text": "Hypothesis",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.35243230121379043,
        "y0": 0.8320743107424178,
        "x1": 0.3764988297473549,
        "y1": 0.8416239116093089
      },
      "text": "Path",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5370725172786537,
        "y0": 0.8320743107424178,
